aj_Oblodra\" title=\"Araj Oblodra\">Araj Oblodra</a> on the ground floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brem\" title=\"Brem\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/25px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/38px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/50px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Brem\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png/25px-Portrait_Brem.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Portrait_Brem.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Brem\" title=\"Brem\">Brem</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim_Basement\" title=\"Zhentarim Basement\">Zhentarim Basement</a> after gaining the Zhentarim's trust</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/38px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/50px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Derryth Bonecloak\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png/25px-Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Derryth_Bonecloak.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Derryth_Bonecloak\" title=\"Derryth Bonecloak\">Derryth Bonecloak</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Ebonlake_Grotto\" title=\"Ebonlake Grotto\">Ebonlake Grotto</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Carmen_Pennygood\" title=\"Carmen Pennygood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/38px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/50px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Carmen Pennygood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Portrait_Carmen_Pennygood.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Carmen_Pennygood\" title=\"Carmen Pennygood\">Carmen Pennygood</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Carm%27s_Garms\" title=\"Carm's Garms\">Carm's Garms</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/38px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/50px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Figaro Pennygood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png\" class=\"mw-file-s